y-triangle' | replace: '//', '/' }}"><img src="{{ 'suiji-studio-triangle-earrings.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Line / Triangle" width="1200" height="1400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=""><p class="r-eyebrow">SUIJI study · Concept</p><h3>Line / Triangle</h3><p>A graphic outline with room for light and movement.</p></a></article></div></div><div data-gallery-panel="candidates" hidden class="r-empty"><h2>A new round is being prepared.</h2><p>There are no verified public voting candidates or live vote counts here.</p></div><div data-gallery-panel="finished" hidden class="r-empty"><h2>See the pieces already in the collection.</h2><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/collections/all' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Explore the pieces<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Bring your own starting point</h2></div><p>See how an idea becomes a charm to discuss.</p><a class="r-button" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/studio-workspace' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Try the workspace<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/design-studio' | replace: '//', '/' }}">How co-creation works<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section></div>
